#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# All text is stored and checked out with lf: the cross-stack contract hashes
# the source text and renders byte-comparable JSON, so a Windows checkout must
# not differ from the Linux CI checkout.
*               text=auto eol=lf

# Linux start script should use lf
/gradlew        text eol=lf

# These are Windows script files and should use crlf
*.bat           text eol=crlf
